<title>POLAND: OPTIMUS MULLS GDR SCHEME, NO NEW ISSUE.</title>
<headline>OPTIMUS MULLS GDR SCHEME, NO NEW ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish computer maker Optimus SA is mulling an issue of Global Depositary Receipts (GDRs) for some of its existing shares, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Optimus said it did not intend to carry out a new share issue for the GDR programme.</p>
<p>The statement gave no further details and a company official declined to comment on the issue.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
